01:07:36.180 --> 01:07:38.300
But still, that felt more like Castlevania.

01:07:38.300 --> 01:07:48.440
And I feel like maybe that's the story here of just, like, what we're seeing in general with the NES games is just that the difference between 1 and 2 was maybe just too extreme.

01:07:48.500 --> 01:07:50.980
